## Implementation Strategy

This project follows a phased approach to create a comprehensive 15,000-20,000 word Docusaurus textbook with 4 modules covering Physical AI & Humanoid Robotics. The implementation will proceed in priority order based on user stories, with each phase building on the previous to deliver independently testable increments.

**MVP Scope**: Phase 1 (Project Foundation) + Phase 2 (Module 1 - Weeks 1-5) provides the complete textbook structure with first module content, ready for review.

