## Dependencies

1. **Phase 1 (Setup)** must complete before any other phases
2. **Phase 2 (Foundational)** must complete before user story phases begin
3. **Phase 3 (US1)** provides the foundational structure needed for other modules
4. **Phase 4 (US2)** builds upon the structure established in US1
5. **Phase 5 (US3)** completes the full textbook content
6. **Phase 6 (Polish)** can only begin after all content phases are complete

