## Implementation Notes

- Each module targets 3-4 diagrams and 5 conceptual examples as specified in the requirements
- Word counts are specified per section to meet the overall 15,000-20,000 target
- Content should focus on conceptual understanding rather than implementation details
- All content must follow Docusaurus Markdown format with proper frontmatter
- Diagrams should be created in SVG/PNG format with proper alt text for accessibility
- Examples should be conceptual text-based rather than executable code since this is a textbook